# AGME – Anganwadi Government Merchant Education

## Overview

AGME (Anganwadi Government Merchant Education) is a cloud-based digital education platform designed to transform the traditional education system of Anganwadi and Government schools using AI-powered, game-based, and low-cost digital learning solutions.

The platform integrates interactive learning, student progress tracking, and educational gaming (MAGGI) to provide engaging and accessible education for students from rural and low-income communities.

🌐 Website: http://682475b4981c4.site123.me/

---

## Problem Statement

Government schools lack digital infrastructure, quality education access, transparency, and student engagement opportunities nationwide.

---

## Solution

AGME provides a scalable digital learning platform that delivers:

- AI-powered personalized education
- Game-based learning through MAGGI educational game
- Real-time student progress tracking
- Teacher and parent monitoring dashboards
- Low-cost and offline accessible mobile application
- Cloud-based secure and scalable infrastructure

