## Architecture Overview

The AGME platform follows a cloud-based architecture:

### Frontend
- Flutter Mobile App (Student)
- Web Dashboard (Teacher/Admin)

### Backend
- Node.js API Server
- Cloud-based database

### Cloud Infrastructure
- AWS EC2 – Server hosting
- AWS S3 – Content storage
- AWS DynamoDB – Student data storage
- AWS Lambda – Backend logic
- AWS SNS – SMS notifications
- AWS Cognito – Authentication

### AI Integration
- Python AI models
- Personalized learning recommendation engine

### Game Engine
- Unity Engine (MAGGI Educational Game)

